<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #222;">
  <p>Hello {{name}},</p>
  <p>
    Thank you for contacting {{orgName}}. Your request has been recorded with
    the reference <strong>{{ticketRef}}</strong>.
  </p>
  <p style="margin: 16px 0 4px;"><strong>What you told us</strong></p>
  <p style="margin: 0; white-space: pre-wrap;">{{problem}}</p>
  <p style="margin-top: 16px;">
    Recorded on {{date}}. A specialist will get back to you. Please keep the
    reference above if you contact us again about this request.
  </p>
  <p style="margin-top: 24px; color: #666; font-size: 12px;">
    This message was sent because you asked for help in our chat.
  </p>
</div>
